==Strategy==
==='''Chapter 1 (Cheese)'''===
'''Lineup:''' Bring a Starting Money Up Combo and one or two Attack Up (Sm) combos (depending on how many units are required for your money up combo. For example, [[Cool Japan (Combo)|Cool Japan]] + [[Bento Special (Combo)|Bento Special]] is a good one, or [[Tiny Ancient Hunt (Combo)|Tiny Ancient Hunt]] + [[Sister Act (Combo)|Sister Act]] + [[Offshore Accounts (Combo)|Offshore Accounts]]), [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] (40), [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] (30), [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Eraser Cat]]
(30), [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Maglev Cat]] (30), [[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Lion Cat]] (30), [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Leg Cat]] (20+10).

You are going to want to rush the base and destroy it before Nimoy Bore spawns in. This is harder than the normal version of this level because you have a few less seconds to do so. The higher level your units are, the better.

Start by luring the first Mistress Celeboodle a little close, before chipping her with Macho Leg Cat and killing her with Maglev Cat. This will give you a lot of money, and you can summon Awakened Bahamut Cat instantly to start destroying the enemy base. Spam your fast units off cooldown, then watch as they thoroughly beat the base. The money from the next Celeboodle will fund your spamming of cats, and you should stack up enough DPS to take out the base before anything too dangerous spawns.

===Chapter 2 (Rush)===
By bringing along any Worker Start Level Up Combos, you can use the first Shibalien as a stepping stone for [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Slime]] to snipe the Celeboodle. If needed, you can use [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Maglev]] to finish it off. Use the money to send out [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|A. Bahamut]] and watch him rip through anything. [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can]] can be added for supplemental damage on the base, and [[Ancient Egg: N108 (Super Rare Cat)|Soap]] can keep Suidae Piggicus stuck behind the base if necessary.

