==Trivia==
*Urura and all other stages from [[Darararah (Cats of the Cosmos)|Darararah]] through [[Ababwa (Cats of the Cosmos)|Ababwa]] have a robot (from the [[wikipedia:Mobile Suit Gundam|''Mobile Suit Gundam'']] series) on top of their base, with the lower half being the Pegasus White Base.
*Urura's Japanese name, Urarū (ウラルー), may be a vague reference to ''Mobile Suit Gundam''<nowiki>'</nowiki>s [[wikia:gundam:Luna II|Luna II]], which is pronounced as Runatsū (ルナツー) in Japanese.

